        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 bg-white mb-4">
            <h1 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--primary-color);">Institutional Best Practices</h1>
            <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
                AGM Rural College of Engineering & Technology has established institutional best practices designed to empower rural engineering aspirants, foster technical innovation, and instill strong ethical values under the mentorship of SDM Jainmatt Trust.
            </p>

            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-xs bg-light p-4 rounded-4">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                            <div class="bg-primary text-white p-3 rounded-circle fs-4">
                                <i class="bi bi-lightbulb-fill"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-0">Best Practice 1: Rural Empowerment Through Affordable Quality Technical Education</h5>
                                <span class="badge bg-primary mt-1">Institutional Social Responsibility</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-secondary small leading-relaxed">
                            <strong>Objective:</strong> To make state-of-the-art engineering and management education accessible and affordable to students from rural and economically weaker sections in Karnataka.<br><br>
                            <strong>Implementation:</strong> AGMRCET provides subsidized transport facilities, merit-cum-means scholarship assistance, dedicated skill development workshops, and personalized mentoring to bridge urban-rural educational disparities.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-xs bg-light p-4 rounded-4">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                            <div class="bg-success text-white p-3 rounded-circle fs-4">
                                <i class="bi bi-laptop-fill"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-0">Best Practice 2: Industry-Aligned Skill Enhancement & Hands-On Virtual Labs</h5>
                                <span class="badge bg-success mt-1">Academic Innovation</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-secondary small leading-relaxed">
                            <strong>Objective:</strong> To enhance graduate employability through practical skill certification, industry mentorship, and Ministry of Education Virtual Labs.<br><br>
                            <strong>Implementation:</strong> Integration of project-based learning from the 3rd semester onwards, compulsory technical internships, hackathons, and corporate placement training modules.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

